Kimi K2.5 is now a default provider in BrowserOS.

@browseros_ai is an open-source browser with a built-in AI agent — it can browse the web, fill forms, connect to apps via MCP, and run multi-step workflows. Think @Openclaw, but browser-native.

To celebrate the launch with @Kimi_Moonshot, all BrowserOS users get 2 weeks of extended Kimi K2.5 usage — free. No API key required. 👇
